{"id":"e71ac0c5f26e4df4","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-self-singleton.md","title":"自索引单元素集","display":"cor-self-singleton — 自索引单元素集","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-self-singleton","aliases":["20-cor-self-singleton"],"display":"cor-self-singleton — 自索引单元素集","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 2.2.3","source_pdf_pages":[66],"source_printed_pages":[30],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-recursion]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-self-singleton"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-self-singleton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-self-singleton — 自索引单元素集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 2.2.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>66</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>30</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 是标准 c.e. 编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f